WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.760
It's time to get hands-on with ZOSMF.

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:12.080
Now, the screens I showed you were from the desktop version of ZOSMF, and this lab uses

3
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.760
the traditional menu-driven approach.

4
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.800
Under the covers, it's all the same, but this way you get to see both versions, because

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.320
not all mainframe shops are going to use the same one.

6
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.880
You'll log into ZOSMF using the Firefox browser located on your virtual machine's desktop.

7
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.560
Then you'll explore around a little bit, see how to connect to the consoles, enter some

8
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.880
commands, and check out the system configuration.

9
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.240
There's a lot to do in here, so let's get started.
